{"parse": {"title": "LAFP-08", "pageid": 136115, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/LAFP-07\" title=\"LAFP-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">LAFP-08</span><a href=\"/wiki/LAFP-09\" title=\"LAFP-09\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">LAFP</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.A4.9C.E9.97.B4.E6.94.80.E7.99.BB.E8.80.85\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"夜间攀登者\">夜间攀登者</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 夜间攀登者</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Night Climber</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>峰<span class=\"color-value\"></span>顶<span class=\"color-value\"></span>等<span class=\"color-value\"></span>待<span class=\"color-value\"></span>日<span class=\"color-value\"></span>出<span class=\"color-value\"></span>时<span class=\"color-value\"></span>分<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3610108</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_bg_17.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_bg_17\"><img alt=\"3_6_bg_17\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/Cg-3_6_bg_17.png/600px-Cg-3_6_bg_17.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/Cg-3_6_bg_17.png/900px-Cg-3_6_bg_17.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/Cg-3_6_bg_17.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_bg_17.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>你又要出门爬山了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>这次是哪儿，瓦茨曼山，还是内贝尔峰？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>不，这次是西班牙，比利牛斯山脉的最高峰——阿内托峰。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_bg_05.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_bg_05\"><img alt=\"3_6_bg_05\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Cg-3_6_bg_05.png/600px-Cg-3_6_bg_05.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Cg-3_6_bg_05.png/900px-Cg-3_6_bg_05.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Cg-3_6_bg_05.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_bg_05.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-648701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-648701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-648701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>你刚结束外派任务吧，休息了一天就恢复精力了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>只是去摩洛哥协助建立神秘学家档案管理系统而已，我在飞机上就已经睡够了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>那你呢？看你的样子，又在熬夜研究？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>不过我听说过拉普拉斯的人都喜好昼伏夜出，看来你不必特地花时间适应他们的节奏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>通宵的工作让阿德勒略显萎靡，唯独那双眼睛却亮得出奇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>天才的想法都会在夜晚迸发——一句诗性至极的感慨，但我更认为这是理性的经验总结。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>格蕾塔耸耸肩，并不打算在这个问题上如父母那般啰嗦。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_bg_20_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_bg_20_zone\"><img alt=\"3_6_bg_20_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/35/Cg-3_6_bg_20_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"1220\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"120\" data-file-height=\"244\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>记得——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>我知道，修剪草坪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_bg_05.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_bg_05\"><img alt=\"3_6_bg_05\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Cg-3_6_bg_05.png/600px-Cg-3_6_bg_05.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Cg-3_6_bg_05.png/900px-Cg-3_6_bg_05.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Cg-3_6_bg_05.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_bg_05.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>注意到这阵沉默，格蕾塔再次缓下了关门的动作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>你似乎还有话想对我说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>这个月是建立神秘学家档案，上个月是协调神秘学家纠纷，为基金会收拾烂摊子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>其余的也不必举例了。格蕾塔，这就是你在基金会的主要工作，就像老妈永远都在清理门后的灰尘——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>日复一日，年复一年。但这是关上窗就能解决的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>我明白你有多不乐意一直偷偷地、反复地帮她清理了，但这句话不要让老妈知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>只是，阿德勒——你的意思是，永远都要关上窗吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>不，我的意思是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>格蕾塔摆了摆手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>我的确没有和你好好说过，我为什么会选择加入基金会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>当然，外派调查员的工作如你所说，流程繁杂，情况大多数简单到并不需要一颗天才的大脑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>事件的复杂程度取决于交涉官员的态度。全看他们是否乐于摒弃繁文缛节与空泛套话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>如果从功利的角度判断，这也是不理智的选择，毕竟它的升职前景也十分有限。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>那你为什么还在坚持？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>弟弟的执拗不解意味着这不会是一场短暂的对话。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_bg_20_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_bg_20_zone\"><img alt=\"3_6_bg_20_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/35/Cg-3_6_bg_20_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"1220\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"120\" data-file-height=\"244\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她看了一眼墙面的挂钟，犹豫片刻，拎了拎肩上的背包。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>阿德勒，你听说过乔戈里峰吗，或者K2峰？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-648701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-648701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-648701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>仅次于珠穆朗玛峰的世界第二高峰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>没错。我很喜欢K2峰的称呼，以数字和字母组成，直白、赤裸、简洁，不需要任何多余的修饰，恰如它“残暴巨峰”的原始形象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>攀登这座山峰的死亡率远高于攀登世界第一高峰，只要做出了攀登的决定，就已经将生命托付给严酷的自然抉择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>就算在登山俱乐部里，除却对攀登者决心的称赞，我相信大部分人依旧在感叹“这是在找死”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>……我不明白你提到这个的含义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>站在K2峰顶点俯瞰的景观，与你现在、在哥廷根大学里、在任何其他地方所看到的景观，都不会一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>这就是那些“找死”的人想要获得的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>不过，基金会外派职员绝大多数情况下，不会陷入如此极端的情景。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>我不能理解神秘学，也不能理解以此生存的神秘学家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>但这二者根深蒂固地存在于这个世界上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>基金会是一个很好的支点，一个窗口，一个既能俯瞰，又能参与其中的位置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>就算我不愿意，也不得不和各异的神秘学家以及神秘术打交道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>——而他们，就隐藏在那些枝蔓横生的官僚制度之下。这是进入基金会才能得到的视野。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>每一个神秘学家都会成为一个案例，无论是多么奇诡的现象，在得到系统性的记录分析之后，也一定能纳入可追溯的逻辑链中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>阿德勒，你的科学在寻求一个统一的理论，出发点是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>……让世界变得简洁、得以归纳，让它真正变得可知、可依赖与适宜生存。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>那么社会是否也能有这样的理论？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>整合无序、混乱、割裂，让神秘学家与神秘术在理性中找到它的位置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>我相信我现在就在做这件事。这些没有尽头的外派出差，我将其理解为暴力的穷举，就像一个人愚拙地想要数清海滩上沙子的数量。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>一旦完成了，这便是建立在理性上、足以让人信赖的完整图景——关于人类与神秘学家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>噢，你可以称之为“霍夫曼理想主义”，我们之间的共性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>好了，你可以走了！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_bg_05.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_bg_05\"><img alt=\"3_6_bg_05\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Cg-3_6_bg_05.png/600px-Cg-3_6_bg_05.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Cg-3_6_bg_05.png/900px-Cg-3_6_bg_05.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Cg-3_6_bg_05.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_bg_05.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻的攀登者没有理会弟弟的恼羞成怒，她又想起了什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>听说拉普拉斯正在进行神秘术融合实验，之后会给我们派发结合术法力量的装备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>……我不会信赖难以解析原理的“魔法”武器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>嗯，意料之中的反应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>我知道了。这会更适合你——一把鲁格手枪。普通的枪，可以拆解和重组。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_bg_20_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_bg_20_zone\"><img alt=\"3_6_bg_20_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/35/Cg-3_6_bg_20_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"1220\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"120\" data-file-height=\"244\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>手枪？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>我现在也有一把手枪，基金会外派职员的外勤用枪，而我的射击水平已经很不错了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-648701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-648701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-648701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>格蕾塔，什么任务会需要配枪？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-648801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>极端的情况少见，但总会出现，必要时可以用它来防身。你我都是。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_at_07.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_at_07\"><img alt=\"3_6_at_07\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/Cg-3_6_at_07.png/600px-Cg-3_6_at_07.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/Cg-3_6_at_07.png/900px-Cg-3_6_at_07.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/Cg-3_6_at_07.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_at_07.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她背好了登山包。那扇半掩的门彻底敞开，朝阳笼罩了她，她即将融化在光芒之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>我要出发了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>——等等，格蕾塔！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>时间不等人，阿德勒，我总是要去的。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_at_08.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_at_08\"><img alt=\"3_6_at_08\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-3_6_at_08.png/600px-Cg-3_6_at_08.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-3_6_at_08.png/900px-Cg-3_6_at_08.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-3_6_at_08.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_at_08.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">格蕾塔：</div><div>世界上的所有山，也总会有人去的。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_bg_11.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_bg_11\"><img alt=\"3_6_bg_11\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-3_6_bg_11.png/600px-Cg-3_6_bg_11.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-3_6_bg_11.png/900px-Cg-3_6_bg_11.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-3_6_bg_11.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_bg_11.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_bg_18_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_bg_18_zone\"><img alt=\"3_6_bg_18_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/a7/Cg-3_6_bg_18_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"462\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"156\" data-file-height=\"120\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒 ：</div><div>等等，我也——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_at_10.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_at_10\"><img alt=\"3_6_at_10\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/Cg-3_6_at_10.png/600px-Cg-3_6_at_10.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/Cg-3_6_at_10.png/900px-Cg-3_6_at_10.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/Cg-3_6_at_10.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_at_10.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德勒：</div><div>格蕾塔——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>格蕾塔……格蕾塔！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他不停地将拳头砸在眼前纹丝不动的门上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一扇他熟悉的门。一扇他自始至终都想敲开的门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一扇他曾已敲开，只为天才而开的门。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_b2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi\"><img alt=\"2_4_b2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-632911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-632911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-632911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>……先生、阿德勒先生！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-314312.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314312.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314312.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-314312.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314312.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-314312.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314312.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他恍然回神。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拉普拉斯的会议室里，无数双眼睛正盯着他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>阿德勒研究员，你最近总在会议中精神不振。你该去好好睡一觉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>睡眠对人类而言必不可少，它……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>感谢你对人类颇具洞察力的提议，不必了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>——关于现在的情况，我们必须考虑接下来的应对办法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>话题重新接续，天才们不再将注意力放在微不足道的睡眠话题上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>路德维希的再次出现给我们添了个大麻烦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>现在核心已经不在我们手上了——这道填字游戏已经彻底被撕毁，线索也无从谈起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>没有线索，密码学家也无法无中生有地反推密钥。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>那很好办，我的建议是把这个箱子拆了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>不管是路德维希还是核心，都还在里头，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>拆了！让所有元素回归到单子状态，这样的解析说不定更直观。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>太鲁莽了，兔毛手袋研究员！拆解“玩具箱”说不定只会造成数据的遗失和损毁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>这甚至会损坏“玩具箱”本身，到那时什么研究都不可能进行了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>哈，那看来你更喜欢在这儿冥思苦想，这样的确不会造成任何后果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>——直接重启吧，然后继续我们先前的计划。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>密码学家及时地打断了一场即将生成的争论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>“玩具箱”的情况仍然不稳定。在这种情况下重置它，我们不能确定究竟是造成更大的混乱，还是让一切恢复原样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>路德维希的信号仍然在高塔附近。我们得趁他离开前赶紧下决定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>别犹豫了。等待是徒劳的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>而且，既然重启之后数据会被复原，不妨先假设路德维希这个意外也能被修复。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>先假设，再验证。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "LAFP-08"}}